@Users.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@Catalog.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:44339
@authToken = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Principais operações da API de catálogo de jogos
### 1. Autenticar e obter token
# @name login
POST {{Users.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@fiapcloud.com.br",
  "password": "admin"
}

###

### 2. Cadastrar um novo jogo
POST {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/game/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Resident Evil X",
  "description": "A new chapter in the Resident Evil series, combining survival horror with intense action.",
  "genre": "Action",
  "release": "2026-12-01",
  "price": 79.99
}
###

### 3. Adicionar um jogo ao catálogo de um usuário
POST {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/catalog/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "gameId": 1,
  "userEmail": "admin@fiapcloud.com.br",
  "price": 79.99
}
###

### Demais operações:

### Obter todos os jogos
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/game/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
###

### Obter um jogo específico
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/game/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
###

### Atualizar um jogo existente
PUT {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/game/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Resident Evil X - Remastered",
  "description": "Remastered edition with improved visuals and extra content.",
  "genre": "Action",
  "release": "2027-01-25",
  "price": 80.00
}
###

### Remover um jogo
DELETE {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/game/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
###